        <mxCell id="v-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A&quot;&gt;03. Slack 질문 → Thread 답변 E2E&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;3초 안의 ACK 경계와 수 분이 걸릴 수 있는 AI 실행을 분리하고, 중복·중단에도 결과를 보존하는 흐름&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="42" y="22" width="1716" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#611F69;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;1 · SLACK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;사용자 app_mention&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;event_id · channel · event.ts&lt;br&gt;질문 원문&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="190" width="200" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#C2410C;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;2 · HTTPS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Cloudflare Tunnel&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;개발용 공개 URL → localhost:8000&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="310" y="190" width="200" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#2563EB;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;3 · FASTAPI&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;서명·이벤트 검증&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Raw body HMAC + Timestamp&lt;br&gt;Bot/subtype/빈 질문 제외&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="190" width="215" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803D;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;4 · T1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;멱등 Job 접수&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;UNIQUE(source,event_id)&lt;br&gt;Job + Job Outbox 원자 저장&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="805" y="190" width="220" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#2563EB;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;5 · ACK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;즉시 2xx 반환&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;LLM·Embedding·Slack 발신 없음&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1065" y="190" width="200" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;중복 event_id는 새 Job을 만들지 않고 기존 job_id를 반환한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#15803D;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1320" y="198" width="380" height="98" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#7C3AED;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;6 · OUTBOX&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Job 발행&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;SKIP LOCKED 임대 선점&lt;br&gt;Confirm 뒤 SENT/QUEUED&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="505" width="205" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#F97316;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;7 · RABBITMQ&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;durable delivery&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Job Queue · prefetch=1&lt;br&gt;최소 한 번 전달&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="330" y="505" width="195" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803D;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;8 · WORKER&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;멱등 Job 선점&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;상태 조건부 UPDATE&lt;br&gt;중복 delivery는 실행하지 않고 ACK&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="570" y="505" width="205" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0F766E;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;9 · LANGGRAPH&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;RAG 실행&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Ollama + pgvector&lt;br&gt;노드 Checkpoint·한도 있는 재시도&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="505" width="205" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803D;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;10 · T4&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;결과 원자 확정&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Completed + Citation + Reply Outbox&lt;br&gt;또는 Review Required&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1070" y="505" width="215" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#611F69;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;11 · REPLY OUTBOX · FLAG&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Slack 답변 발행&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;SLACK_REPLY_ENABLED=true&lt;br&gt;thread_ts · client_msg_id · Backoff&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1330" y="505" width="230" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#611F69;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;12 · SLACK THREAD&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;사용자에게 답변&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;원본 메시지와 같은 Thread&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1595" y="505" width="135" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v-6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;실패 시 ACK 전에 무작정 재실행하지 않는다. 오류를 DB에 저장해 RETRY_WAIT / REVIEW_REQUIRED / DEAD_LETTER로 분류한 뒤 ACK한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420" y="665" width="850" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="metrics" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A&quot;&gt;Prometheus Metrics&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#475569;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;ACK 지연 · Queue · Workflow · Retry&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="835" width="350" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="logs" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A&quot;&gt;JSON Logs → Alloy → Loki&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#475569;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;request_id · job_id · thread_id · node duration&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
